WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
boss

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,760
It was your robot that moved first

3
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,360
I was forced to defend myself

4
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:06,400
Look at my arms

5
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,280
Even though I knocked it myself

6
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,200
But the monitoring wires are not connected

7
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,600
It's scary at first glance

8
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,820
Now everyone in the base knows about your hotel.

9
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:16,500
If it's really good

10
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:17,740
Everyone moves in

11
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:19,060
Jinhe is not a problem at all

12
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:22,220
But I never expected it

13
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:25,500
You will beat people here without distinguishing between black and white.

14
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,220
What's more, I'm at the base

15
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,500
He is also a respectable person

16
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:29,940
The right to speak is not small either.
